OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAlthough
OL,6,Fsome clear intervals are likely there
OL,7,Fwill be a fair amount of cloud during
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight, with the
OL,9,Fpossibility of producing a few
OL,10,Fshowers. Feeling rather cool compared
OL,11,Fto recent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,14,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,15,FCloud will turn the sunshine hazy
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon, with sunnier
OL,17,Fweather returning later. Fresher than
OL,18,Frecent days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
